WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.409
The lab runs the guide's Step
3 and Step 4 checks in a test

2
00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:08.037
subscription where someone has applied
those steps to a test application.

3
00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:11.237
Nothing in Azure changes, and
the authors haven't run it.

4
00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:15.666
You need a DDoS Network Protection
plan linked to a test virtual network,

5
00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:19.946
a protected Standard public I P with
its diagnostic setting and alert,

6
00:00:19.946 --> 00:00:25.038
and a test application behind an Application
Gateway firewall in prevention mode.

7
00:00:25.038 --> 00:00:28.650
Step one lists every
public I P's DDoS state.

8
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.028
The guide's Validate step says
each should show Enabled,

9
00:00:32.028 --> 00:00:35.038
or Virtual Network Inherited
in a linked network.

10
00:00:35.038 --> 00:00:38.159
Step two exports the plan
and its linked networks,

11
00:00:38.159 --> 00:00:40.900
which the guide's
evidence checklist names.

12
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.913
Step three checks the
protected I P's diagnostic

13
00:00:43.913 --> 00:00:46.925
setting and the alert on
the under-attack metric.

14
00:00:46.925 --> 00:00:49.146
The simulation isn't part of the lab:

15
00:00:49.146 --> 00:00:52.340
Learn allows it only
through an approved partner.
